Observation: There is no single dominant "low-cost domestic manufacturer" nationwide comparable to ALMADECO in the Philippines — apart from Asli (fairly large, close to a "national champion"), the rest of the field consists of small fabrication shops across the Klang Valley competing on relationships/price, with little or no formal certification.
2B. International brands & their presence in Malaysia
Brand | Origin | Presence in Malaysia | Segment
