Systemair | Sweden | Own subsidiary — Systemair Sdn Bhd (since 2008, ~150 staff, 16,000 sqm), serving as a regional hub for ASEAN/South Korea/Taiwan; reported to have acquired PHEM Engineering (Malaysia) in 2024 | Fans, air distribution
