Confidence note: Only PTPP (Makassar hospital) and BUMN karya contractors (Waskita, on certain other Kemenkes projects) are publicly confirmed — most private hospitals (Mayapada, Siloam, Hermina, EMC) and KEK factories do NOT disclose their MEP contractor. Macro context : BKPM recorded total realized investment for 2025 at Rp1,931.2 trillion (exceeding target, +12.7% YoY); downstream-processing (hilirisasi) investment reached Rp584.1 trillion (+43.3% YoY). Nationwide there are 25 KEKs , with cumulative 2012-2025 investment of Rp336 trillion , of which 2025 alone attracted Rp82.6 trillion (98% of the annual target), employing 249,000 workers. Air-terminal opportunity is concentrated in office/worker-housing/administrative blocks within heavy industrial parks (IMIP, IWIP) and in the more "conventional building"-type consumer-goods/chemical plants (KEK Kendal, Batang, Gresik).
1D. Commercial Real Estate (Mall/Office/Condo)
