2C. Key MEP consultants & specification standards
• Arkonin (Jakarta) — MEP consultant on numerous major projects (Bintaro Xchange 2, MRT Blok A); specific reference standards not yet verified.
• Meinhardt Indonesia — green-building projects (Jakarta Mori Tower BCA Green Mark Platinum, Trinity Tower GBCI Greenship Gold); ISO 9001/14001/45001 certified; implies use of ASHRAE 62.1/90.1 on premium projects.
• WSP Indonesia , Arup Indonesia (involved in Jakarta MRT, the Jakarta-Cikampek tollway, IKN) — international firms, likely to apply international standards alongside SNI.
• Indonesia''s core design standard : SNI 6572:2024 "Standar Ventilasi Gedung" (Building Ventilation Standard, replacing SNI 03-6572-2001), issued by the Ministry of Public Works (Cipta Karya) — this is the legal baseline and does NOT mandate AMCA-style product certification. Premium/green projects (LEED/Greenship) typically "layer" ASHRAE standards on top of the SNI baseline — this is precisely the gap where STARDUCT''s AMCA data can create genuine differentiation versus uncertified domestic fabricators.
