Confidence note: Kai Tak Hospital and the North District Hospital Expansion are the two most notable MEP-intensive projects (numerous cleanrooms, operating theatres, demanding HVAC requirements). San Tin Technopole remains at the planning stage — no specific MEP package expected in the next 1–2 years.
1D. Commercial Real Estate (Mall/Office/Condo)
