Assessment: HK''s commercial real estate market is in a cautious phase — NWD is undergoing heavy debt restructuring, Swire has just completed its latest major investment cycle, while SHKP/CK Asset/Wheelock/Kerry remain active in acquiring new residential land. Near-term air-terminal HVAC opportunities are concentrated more in hospitals/data centers/logistics (1A/1C) than in premium office/mall developments (1D) for 2026-2028. No developer publicly discloses the name of its MEP contractor — a common practice in HK (main contractors select their own subcontractors and rarely make press announcements about it).
