Assessment: the apartment reconstruction (재건축) segment is the richest and most current data source, thanks to close press coverage of the 2026 race between Hyundai E&C, GS E&C, and Samsung C&T — contract value, scale, and general contractor names are all clearly confirmed. This is a promising entry point for STARDUCT, since each high-rise requires large volumes of standard grilles/diffusers/dampers, with less premium-brand sensitivity than Grade-A office buildings. However, the M&E/HVAC subcontractors for these projects are not publicly disclosed — access would need to run through the general contractor or the MEP design consultant.
PART 2 — AIR TERMINAL SUPPLIER COMPETITIVE MAP
2A. Domestic Korean Manufacturers/Fabricators
