Key observation: fire dampers in Korea fall under a separate regulatory framework (see 3C) — a foreign supplier wishing to sell fire dampers will almost certainly have to go through a separate domestic certification process (in addition to AMCA); otherwise it can only participate in the standard grille/diffuser segment.
