Prepared: 14/08/2026. Audience: CEO / Business Development. Style: direct, data-driven, with explicit data gaps flagged. This report runs in parallel with the previously prepared Philippines/Malaysia/Indonesia/Thailand/Cambodia/Hong Kong/Macau/Singapore/South Korea reports — same methodology, same analytical framework.
