Confidence note: high for Sobha (Dh50 billion, Dh40 billion) and Aldar (Dh3.8 billion, major press sources); low for Emaar, DAMAC, Nakheel, as the sources found were mainly secondary broker/blog sites — direct access to each developer''s IR/press release pages is needed before using this for decisions. None of the projects in this group disclose specific MEP/HVAC contractor names — a common characteristic of the UAE residential real estate sector, where MEP is typically an anonymous subcontractor beneath the main contractor (ALEC, Al Naboodah, China State Construction, BESIX).
Overall Part 1 assessment : the clearest opportunity in terms of volume/repeatability lies in 1A (data centers) and 1D (residential/commercial real estate) — both have fast rollout speed, with dozens of parallel projects. 1B infrastructure carries the largest contract values but has long tender cycles (2026-2032) and low MEP transparency. 1C has potential for specialized products (cleanroom, hospital clean spaces) but the UAE''s scale is smaller than Saudi Arabia''s. STARDUCT should approach tier-2 MEP contractors directly (ALEC Data Center Solutions, Al Naboodah MEP, ALEMCO, Crown House Technology) rather than owners.
PART 2 — AIR TERMINAL SUPPLIER COMPETITIVE LANDSCAPE
2A. UAE Domestic Manufacturers/Fabricators
Company | Location | Products/Certifications
Airmaster Equipments Emirates LLC ★ direct competitor | Ajman Industrial Area (since 1987); 8 manufacturing facilities across the GCC | Grilles/registers (linear bar, egg-crate, door, floor, decorative), diffusers (ceiling, swirl, linear slot), dampers, louvers, fire dampers/fire doors, VAV boxes, sound attenuators, galvanized steel & stainless steel ductwork. Certifications: ISO 9001:2015, AMCA (narrow scope — only the ASTL louver model for "Wind Driven Sand"), ETL (ANSI/ASHRAE 70, ADC 1062-GRD84), UL classified fire damper/fire door, Civil Defence Dubai/Abu Dhabi/Ajman, ROP Oman, registered ADCE MEP supplier. Exports to: Saudi Arabia, Australia, Sri Lanka, Egypt, Oman, Indonesia, Malaysia, Philippines , Ethiopia, Jordan, Iraq. Claims 2,500+ projects, including Burj Khalifa.
