Construction Specialties Middle East | Umm Al Quwain | Architectural louvers (American CS brand)
NAFFCO FZCO | Abu Dhabi/Jebel Ali | Fire safety specialist (fire dampers, fire protection systems)
2B. International Brands & Distributors in the UAE
