TROX | TROX Middle East LLC, Al Quoz Industrial Estate 3, Dubai (since the mid-1970s, a direct subsidiary of TROX Germany) | Regional hub (warehousing, assembly, Air Flow Studio, mock-up test room) — not a full manufacturing plant. Has supplied Burj Khalifa, Burj Al Arab, Hamad Airport, Louvre Abu Dhabi
Titus/Ruskin | Ruskin Titus Gulf LLC | Local manufacturing via joint venture
