Part 1 risk summary : Three projects show clear hype/delay/descope signals requiring caution: (1) NEOM "The Line" — severely scaled back; (2) New Murabba/Mukaab — construction paused; (3) many data-center capacity figures (1GW, 6GW) are announced targets without confirmed construction contracts. The most reliable projects to prioritize for engagement (with confirmed contractors, values, and timelines): King Salman International Airport, Riyadh Metro Red Line, Diriyah Gate, Qiddiya (Phase 1), and the mid-sized private hospital contracts (BEC Arabia, National Medical Care).
PART 2 — AIR TERMINAL SUPPLIER COMPETITIVE MAP
2A. Saudi Arabia''s Domestic Manufacturers/Fabricators
The most reliable list is the Saudi Arabia regional membership of AMCA (17 companies AMCA-certified for dampers/louvers/air terminals) — the closest direct competitive group to STARDUCT''s AMCA-aligned positioning.
