Zamil Air Conditioners (Dammam) — a key point requiring clarification : Zamil is the largest HVAC group in the Middle East, but a direct review of its published product catalog (zamilac.com) shows only: split AC, window AC, cassette, packaged units, duct-split, air curtain, and desert cooler — entirely complete packaged equipment , with NO grilles, diffusers, dampers, or duct-distribution accessories in its public catalog. Zamil is NOT a direct competitor in the air-terminal segment — Zamil competes at the equipment tier, while STARDUCT targets the air-distribution accessory tier. It remains unverified whether any other Zamil Industrial subsidiary separately manufactures duct/dampers.
